<%= render "shared/address_chip", street_address: @street_address, area: @alert.area -%>

<% if @matches.size > 1 -%>
Temporary "No Parking" signs may be going up near your address for <%= @matches.size %> upcoming City of Chicago permits.

<% @matches.each_with_index do |match, i| -%>
-- Permit <%= i + 1 %> of <%= @matches.size %> --
<%= render "match", match: match %>
<% end -%>
<% else -%>
Temporary "No Parking" signs may be going up near your address for an upcoming City of Chicago permit.

<%= render "match", match: @matches.first %>
<% end -%>
Signs may already be posted, so check your block before parking. If signs are up and you ignore them, your car may be ticketed or towed.

This is an experimental feature. Opt out anytime: <%= @manage_url %>
<%= render "shared/email_footer",
      disclaimer: true,
      manage_url: @manage_url,
      coffee_context: :permit %>
